# Mapbox Search Box Access Token (public, domain-restricted per environment)
# Get yours at https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/
# Required scopes: styles:read, search:read (default public scope covers these)
# Free tier: ~200K requests/month (2026), no credit card required to start
# IMPORTANT: Restrict this token to your production/staging domain in the Mapbox dashboard
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN=
